# Linux Suspicious Sudo Without TTY
# MITRE ATT&CK: T1068 (Exploitation for Privilege Escalation)
# Severity: Medium
# Description: Detects sudo execution without a TTY, often used by scripts/malware.

index=linux OR index=os
sourcetype IN ("linux_secure", "syslog")
process_name="sudo" AND message="*TTY=unknown*"
| stats count by _time, host, user, pid, message
| sort - _time
